<title>FINLAND: Finnish April EU-harmonised CPI up 0.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish April EU-harmonised CPI up 0.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish consumer price index harmonised to European Union standards rose 0.9 percent year-on-year in April after a 0.8 percent rise in March, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>			     April 1997     March 1997    April 1996</p>
<p> Yr/Yr			+0.9 pct	 +0.8 pct	+1.2 pct</p>
<p> Mth/Mth		    +0.3 pct	 +0.4 pct	+0.2 pct</p>
<p> Index (base 1996=100)   100.9	    100.6	    n/a</p>
</text>
